# Prebuilt libretro cores too large for GitHub (34-65 MB each).
# Download from https://buildbot.libretro.com/nightly/android/latest/arm64-v8a/
# and drop into JGamer/app/src/main/jniLibs/arm64-v8a/ before building JGamer.
WebRTC/Mobile/JGamer/app/src/main/jniLibs/**/mame2010_libretro_android.so
WebRTC/Mobile/JGamer/app/src/main/jniLibs/**/fbneo_libretro_android.so
WebRTC/Mobile/JGamer/app/src/main/jniLibs/**/mame2003_plus_libretro_android.so
WebRTC/Mobile/JGamer/app/src/main/jniLibs/**/mame2003_libretro_android.so

